sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant View as HomeworkEditorView
  participant Controller as HomeworkController
  participant Service as HomeworkService
  participant Permission as CoursePermissionClient
  participant Repository as JdbcHomeworkRepository
  participant Config as Question/TestCase Repository
  participant Publisher as NotificationEventPublisher
  Teacher->>View: 填写配置并保存草稿
  View->>Controller: POST/PUT /api/v1/homeworks
  Controller->>Service: create/update(command, currentUser)
  Service->>Permission: canManageCourse(userId, courseId)
  Permission-->>Service: 返回允许或拒绝
  Service->>Repository: 保存 DRAFT 且排除已删除记录
  Service->>Config: 保存题目或测试用例
  Config-->>Service: 返回配置结果
  Service-->>Controller: 返回 Homework
  Controller-->>View: 返回 HomeworkResponse
  Teacher->>View: 确认发布
  View->>Controller: PUT /api/v1/homeworks/{id}/publish
  Controller->>Service: publish(homeworkId, currentUser)
  Service->>Permission: 复核课程管理权限
  Service->>Config: 校验类型配置完整性
  alt 合法且未删除
    Service->>Repository: 在事务中更新 PUBLISHED/publishedAt
    Service->>Publisher: publishRequired(HOMEWORK_PUBLISHED)
    alt 必需通知持久化成功
      Publisher-->>Service: 返回成功
      Service-->>Controller: 返回发布结果
    else 必需通知持久化失败
      Publisher--xService: 抛出投递异常
      Service->>Repository: 回滚并保持 DRAFT
      Service-->>Controller: 返回 HWK_5003
    end
  else 权限、配置或状态冲突
    Service-->>Controller: 返回稳定 HWK 错误码
  end
